{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/23/1725440/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コープスパーティー Book of Shadows"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クランクアップしました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ言える事は、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最高の作品が出来上がったと言う事！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"共演者の皆さん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフの皆さん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心から尊敬しています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私に沢山の刺激を与えてくださってありがとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んなあたたかい気持ちが溢れてきて、うまく文章に起こせません(〃ω〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直美ちゃんと前よりもぐっと距離が近くなれた気がします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"直美ちゃんも本当にありがとう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"台本に自分のシーンに付箋を付けていてね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/23/1725440/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっき、最後の付箋を取ったとき、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心がギュッてなったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しい悲しい寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それくらい、向き合えたのは久しぶりでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成が楽しみだ〜！！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/23/1725440/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/04/23/1725440/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんもお楽しみにっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}